      "id": "single-disc-on-highwind",
      "name": "Single-disc",
      "kind": "mod",
      "blurb": "Play the whole game from one Disc 1 image on Highwind. Field maps from Highwind discs 2 and 3 are on Disc 1. Ending/credits movies auto-apply.",
