    {
      "id": "single-disc-on-csr",
      "name": "Single-disc",
      "kind": "mod",
      "version": "0.2.12",
      "blurb": "Play the whole game from one Disc 1 image on CSR. v0.2.12: re-diffed after reverting the CSR v0.14.2 disc3.layer.json field 768 (LASTMAP) edit that skipped the AD3 script 31 PlayMovie/FMUSC opcodes -- both are now restored intact, matching CSR's own layer. Retains the v0.2.10 break-scene (LOST2) and v0.2.8/v0.2.9 D1->D2 transition (BLACKBGB) fixes. Ending/credits movies are re-enabled for playtesting; manip movies remain disabled pending re-validation on this new base.",
      "hint": "CSR. Ending movies included; manip movies not yet re-enabled.",
      "format": "ic-layer-v1",
      "compatibleBases": [
        "csr"
      ],
      "layout": "global",
      "discs": {
        "1": "./single-disc-on-csr/layers/disc1.layer.json"
      },
      "enabled": false,
      "uiHidden": false,
      "hidden": false,
      "beta": true,
      "status": "beta",
      "betaNote": "v0.2.12: single-disc's safe-field merge pulls FIELD/LAS4_2.DAT, LAS4_3.DAT, LAS4_4.DAT, and LASTMAP.DAT wholesale from CSR Disc 3 (they're D3-only edits vs pristine on D1/D2). CSR's disc3.layer.json (commit 965d040) now restores the original PlayMovie/FMUSC opcodes on field 768 (LASTMAP, AD3 script 31) that were previously routed around by a goto/label skip -- this addon layer was re-diffed against that updated CSR source so the fix flows through. Rebuilt in one pass via build_work_bin.py (all field merges + verified BLACKBGB manual splice + SNOVA inject + FIELD.BIN/WORLD.BIN table fix) and re-diffed against the CSR v0.14.2 D1 base. Not yet playtested past the Disc 3 ending sequence on DuckStation -- please playtest a full run through the ending. Manip movies and endings are currently disabled while this core is playtested standalone."
    },
